    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL BET \u2013 FIGHTING CASINO \u2013</strong><br>A high-stakes <i>Gambling \u00d7 Card Battle</i> game where strategy meets risk.<br>In a secret underground casino, you command elite fighters and wager chips in intense turn-based duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Open-Card Battles</strong> \u2013 Both players see the same cards. Outsmart your opponent with perfect reads and bold plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BET System</strong> \u2013 Wager chips to power up your move as a <strong>Counter</strong> or <strong>Charge</strong>. Succeed, and deal massive damage or reap huge rewards \u2014 your chips doubled. Fail, and pay the price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode</strong> \u2013 Recruit warriors, strengthen your deck, and dominate the underground casino. Enjoy mini-games, upgrades, and high-risk gambles along the way.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL BET \u2013 FIGHTING CASINO \u2013</strong><br>A high-stakes <i>Gambling \u00d7 Card Battle</i> game where strategy meets risk.<br>In a secret underground casino, you command elite fighters and wager chips in intense turn-based duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Open-Card Battles</strong> \u2013 Both players see the same cards. Outsmart your opponent with perfect reads and bold plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BET System</strong> \u2013 Wager chips to power up your move as a <strong>Counter</strong> or <strong>Charge</strong>. Succeed, and deal massive damage or reap huge rewards \u2014 your chips doubled. Fail, and pay the price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode</strong> \u2013 Recruit warriors, strengthen your deck, and dominate the underground casino. Enjoy mini-games, upgrades, and high-risk gambles along the way.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A One-on-One Turn-Based Fighting Battle Unfolds in a Casino!Will you wager on strategy or luck?The more chips you BET, the stronger your cards become, shifting the tides of battle in an intense, high-stakes showdown.Outwit your opponent, master the mind games, and claim victory and rewards",
